  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      231.79,
      276.36,
      360.07,
      287.35
    ],
    "text": "STATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.87,
      296.18,
      452.19,
      335.65
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2 : This clause introduces a new subsection to section 3 of the Employees\u2019Provident Fund Act, No. 15 of 1958, (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d)and the legal effect of the new subsection will be to assign an identification number to anemployee and employer.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.87,
      344.18,
      451.77,
      374.05
    ],
    "text": "Clause 3 : This clause amends section 5 of the principal enactment and the legal effectof that section as amended will be to invest the moneys in the Fund to erect a building andto pay interest on the monies lying in the suspense account, for the actual period.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.87,
      382.58,
      451.99,
      412.45
    ],
    "text": "Clause 4 : This clause inserts new section 23A of the principal enactment and the legaleffect of that section will be to extend housing benefits and benefits relating to medicaltreatment to every member of the Fund.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.599999904632568,
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.87,
      420.98,
      451.79,
      441.25
    ],
    "text": "Clause 5 : This clause inserts new section 24A in the principal enactment and the legaleffect of that section will be to establish an insurance scheme or a pension scheme.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.599999904632568,
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.87,
      449.78,
      451.79,
      470.05
    ],
    "text": "Clause 6 : This clause amends section 31A of the principal enactment and the legaleffect of that section as amended will be to increase the surcharge to two per centum.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.599999904632568,
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.87,
      478.58,
      451.81,
      508.45
    ],
    "text": "Clause 7 : This clause inserts new section 31B of the principal enactment and the legaleffect of that section will be to impose a duty on every employer having in his employmenta minimum of fifty employees, to furnish a monthly return.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.599999904632568,
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.87,
      516.98,
      451.69,
      537.25
    ],
    "text": "Clause 8 : This clause amends section 37 of the principal enactment and the legal effectof that section as amended will be to increase the fine and imprisonment.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.87,
      545.78,
      451.85,
      566.05
    ],
    "text": "Clause 9 : This clause amends section 46 of the principal enactment is consequential tothe amendments made by clause 5.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
