      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      300.07,
      401.98,
      325.77
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Employees\u2019 ProvidentFund (Amendment) Act, No. of 2011.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      337.03,
      402.07,
      399.57
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 3 of the Employees\u2019 Provident Fund Act, No.15 of 1958, (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d) is hereby amended by the insertion immediatelyafter subsection (1) of that section, of the following newsubsection:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      185.85,
      410.83,
      401.96,
      473.37
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(1A) Where an employee becomes a member of theFund established under subsection (1), theCommissioner-General of Labour shall assign anidentification number to such employee and employerin the prescribed manner.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      484.63,
      401.97,
      510.21
    ],
    "text": "3.Section 5 of the principal enactment is herebyamended in subsection (1) of that section as follows :\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      521.47,
      401.82,
      559.41
    ],
    "text": "(1)by the insertion immediately after paragraph (e)of that subsection, of the following newparagraph :\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      193.29,
      570.67,
      402.0,
      670.17
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(ee)may invest according to such terms andconditions as may be prescribed such amountof moneys of the Fund wihch may becomenecessary for the construction on any land,purchased for that purpose or belonging to orheld by the Fund, of a Secretariat on behalf ofthe Employees\u2019 Provident Fund, for the useof the Fund;\u201d and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
