      542.47,
      397.33,
      670.77
    ],
    "text": "(2) A member of the Fund who subject tothe provisions of subsection (1) makes awithdrawal from the amount lying to his creditin his account, shall upon the completion of aperiod of ten years from the date of suchwithdrawal, subject to the provisions ofparagraphs (b) and (c) of subsection (1) beentitled to make a second withdrawal of suchamount as does not exceed thirty per centumfrom such account for any one of the abovepurposes.",
