      357.55,
      397.28,
      418.89
    ],
    "text": "24A. (1) The Commissioner-General ofLabour may establish an insurance scheme anda pension scheme as the case as may be for thebenefit of the members of the Fund subject tosuch terms and conditions as may be prescribed.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
